  "title": "Butter Tart Squares",
  "description": "These two-layered buttery squares are really good. The first layer is like a flaky cookie made with butter, flour and confectioners ' sugar. The second layer, baked onto the first, is sugary and filled with raisins. This recipe yields twelve squares.",
